Package: tos-darktable
Version: 1.0.16
Architecture: amd64
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Joffy <Irvingfei@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libstdc++6 (>= 12), libgcc-s1, python3 (>= 3.10), systemd
Description: darktable - photography workflow and raw developer for TOS
 darktable is an open source photography workflow application and raw
 developer. This package runs the full darktable desktop, streamed to a
 browser tab, and keeps photographs in a NAS shared folder so they stay
 visible in the File Manager and over SMB.
 .
 The application bundles its own GTK, X and VNC runtime under
 /usr/local/tos-darktable, because TOS 7 ships no desktop libraries and
 darktable requires a newer OpenEXR than the platform root filesystem
 provides.
